@startuml
title Foundation - L1 Serialization Main Flow
actor Caller
participant Serializer
participant JacksonJsonSerializer
participant ObjectMapper
participant SerializedPayload
Caller -> Serializer : serialize(value, options)
Serializer -> JacksonJsonSerializer : implementation
JacksonJsonSerializer -> ObjectMapper : writeValueAsBytes(value)
ObjectMapper --> JacksonJsonSerializer : byte[]
JacksonJsonSerializer -> SerializedPayload : create payload
SerializedPayload --> Caller : payload
Caller -> Serializer : deserialize(payload, type)
Serializer -> JacksonJsonSerializer
JacksonJsonSerializer -> ObjectMapper : readValue(body, type)
ObjectMapper --> Caller : object
@enduml
